"How big menus and the HUD are.","Makes the game fill your whole screen.","Matches the frame rate to your screen\'s refresh rate. Removes tearing.","Varies","The highest frame rate the game aims for. A lower limit keeps your device cooler.","Moves your view up and down slightly while walking.","Shows how charged your attack is, next to the crosshair or the hotbar.","Shows your frame rate on the HUD.","Shows your coordinates on the HUD.","Shows the special FNAW player skins.","Quality","Fancy draws see-through leaves and nicer weather. Fast is quicker.",
"Medium","How clouds are drawn, or turn them off.","Low","How many particles are shown.","Smooth lighting: soft shadows in corners and under blocks.","Shows round shadows under mobs and items.","Fades out terrain at the edge of your render distance.","Smooths textures that are far away. Lower can be faster on weak graphics chips.","Uses custom item textures from resource packs (OptiFine format).","Red and cyan 3D, for 3D glasses.","Celeritas Renderer","Chunk Build Time","How long chunks can be built each frame. Lower stops chunk building from causing stutters, higher loads new chunks faster.",
"Smooth","Nearby First","Smooth builds every changed chunk in the background. Nearby First rebuilds chunks right next to you at once, so placed and broken blocks show up sooner, but it can stutter.","Fog Occlusion","Skips chunks that are completely hidden in fog.","Block Face Culling","Skips the sides of chunks that face away from you.","Hide Entities in Hidden Chunks","Skips mobs and players inside chunks you can\'t see.","How many chunks are rebuilt per frame when Celeritas isn\'t running. Lower is smoother, higher loads changes faster.",
"Fixes chunks that sometimes don\'t show up.","tenthsMs","Culling Time","How long each frame can be spent checking which mobs and chests are hidden behind blocks. Higher hides more of them in crowded places, lower leaves more time for the rest of the frame.","Always Draw Within","Mobs and chests this close are always drawn, without checking whether they\'re hidden.","Fast Chests","Draws chests and ender chests as part of the world, which is much faster. Lids still open normally.","Fast Beds","Draws beds as part of the world, which is much faster.",
"Leaf Culling","HUD Batching","Draws the HUD\'s text and icons together instead of one at a time.","HUD Cache","Redraws the HUD only when something on it changes, and reuses the last picture otherwise.","Entity Model Batching","Draws each mob\'s and player\'s body parts together instead of one by one.","Sign Text Distance","Sign text further away than this isn\'t drawn.","Max Particles","How many particles of each kind are kept at once. Lower helps in explosions and busy lobbies.","Collision Distance","Particles further away than this move without checking for blocks in their way.",
"Screen Edge Margin","Particles just outside the screen are still drawn if they\'re within this distance, so big ones don\'t pop in at the edges.","Packet Time","How long each frame can spend on packets from the server (more when they pile up). Lower is smoother, higher loads chunks faster."," FPS","Background FPS","The frame rate while another window is focused. Lower keeps your device cooler."," sec","Idle After","How long without touching the keyboard or mouse before the frame rate drops.","Idle FPS","The frame rate while idle. Lower keeps your device cooler.",
